1
00:00:00,814 --> 00:00:04,274
(Sheldon:)I was promised a riverboat journey
into the jungles of my subconscious.

2
00:00:04,443 --> 00:00:06,193
(Sheldon:)Instead I get the same question...

3
00:00:06,361 --> 00:00:09,651
(Sheldon:)...I hear from the lady
who slices my bologna at Ralph's.

4
00:00:11,033 --> 00:00:12,363
(Leonard:)I'm sorry. I'll start again.

5
00:00:12,534 --> 00:00:17,034
(Sheldon:)Would it be helpful to you
if I told you about my dreams?

6
00:00:17,372 --> 00:00:19,042
(Leonard:)Um.... I don't know, maybe.

7
00:00:19,208 --> 00:00:24,048
(Sheldon:)I recently had a dream
that I was a giant.

8
00:00:24,213 --> 00:00:29,173
(Sheldon:)But everything around me
was to scale so it all looked normal.

9
00:00:32,513 --> 00:00:35,893
Well, how did you know you were
a giant if everything was to scale?

10
00:00:36,058 --> 00:00:39,308
(Sheldon:)I was wearing size a million pants.

11
00:00:43,565 --> 00:00:46,485
(Leonard:)-Why don't we just talk?
-Ah. The talking cure.

12
00:00:46,652 --> 00:00:48,232
(Sheldon:)Classical Freudian. Good choice.

13
00:00:48,403 --> 00:00:50,403
(Sheldon:)If it will help speed things along...

14
00:00:50,572 --> 00:00:53,742
(Sheldon:)...my answers to the standard
Rorschach inkblot test are:

15
00:00:53,909 --> 00:00:58,579
(Sheldon:)A, a bat, B, a bat, C, a bat...

16
00:00:58,747 --> 00:01:06,027
(Sheldon:)...and D, my father killing my mother
with a hypodermic needle.

